		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="pw_event6_react_hero_1">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『かてるのかな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-26T05:09:57" />
